connection_pool_saturation_3_check_conne.content:
[Runbook: PostgreSQL Connection Pool Saturation and Starvation > Diagnostic Procedures > 3. Check Connection Limits]

Check configured maximum connection limits:
```sql
SHOW max_connections;
SHOW superuser_reserved_connections;
```

