connection_pool_saturation_step_2_config.content:
[Runbook: PostgreSQL Connection Pool Saturation and Starvation > Remediation Steps > Step 2: Configure Session Timeouts]

Set protective timeouts to automatically drop abandoned transactions:
```sql
ALTER SYSTEM SET idle_in_transaction_session_timeout = '60s';
SELECT pg_reload_conf();
```

