lock_contention_deadlocks_step_2_set_loc.content:
[Runbook: PostgreSQL Lock Contention and Serialization Deadlocks > Remediation Steps > Step 2: Set Lock and Statement Timeouts]

Prevent transactions from hanging indefinitely behind locks:
```sql
ALTER SYSTEM SET lock_timeout = '5s';
ALTER SYSTEM SET statement_timeout = '30s';
SELECT pg_reload_conf();
```

